2.5 Project Organization
Twenty-four Agriculture candidates participated in the project.
The candidates were divided into five working groups responsible for managing different production units.
Group	Number of Students	Production Unit
Group One	5	Cage 1
Group Two	5	Cage 2
Group Three	4	Cage 3
Group Four	5	Cage 4
Group Five	5	Cage 5
Each group worked on a rotational duty schedule to ensure that every learner participated in all enterprise activities.


